<% content_for(:page_title, "About Apex Performance") %>

<div class="sp-hero" style="padding:56px 32px 72px;">
  <div class="sp-hero-inner">
    <span class="sp-hero-eyebrow">Since 2009</span>
    <h1>About Apex Performance</h1>
    <p>Auto &amp; truck outfitters who ship parts that fit right the first time.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div style="max-width:1120px; margin:-32px auto 48px; padding:0 32px; position:relative; z-index:5;">
  <div class="sp-detail-card" style="margin:0 0 20px;">
    <h3 style="margin:0 0 12px; font-size:15px; color:#101828;">🔧 Why we exist</h3>
    <p style="font-size:14.5px; color:#3a4453; line-height:1.7; margin:0;">
      Apex started as a two-bay garage in Dallas fitting trucks for job sites and trails. Every week we
      watched good customers buy the wrong part — a brake kit half an inch off, an intake that didn't
      match the trim package — because storefronts sold by lookalike photos instead of verified fitment.
      So we built our catalog the other way around: <strong>every SKU is verified against our
      Year / Make / Model / Trim / Engine database before it ever lists</strong>, and the storefront shows
      you exactly what fits your vehicle.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="sp-detail-grid" style="margin:0 0 20px;">
    <div class="sp-detail-card">
      <h3 style="margin:0 0 12px; font-size:15px; color:#101828;">📍 The shop</h3>
      <ul class="sp-feature-list">
        <li>Warehouse &amp; will-call: 4120 Industrial Blvd, Dallas, TX</li>
        <li>Hours: Mon–Fri 8am–6pm CT, Sat 9am–2pm</li>
        <li>Staffed by 14 techs — average 11 years wrenching</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="sp-detail-card">
      <h3 style="margin:0 0 12px; font-size:15px; color:#101828;">🧪 How we verify fitment</h3>
      <ul class="sp-feature-list">
        <li>Bench-fit every new SKU on at least one donor vehicle</li>
        <li>Fitment data synced to the storefront in real time</li>
        <li>"Guaranteed Exact Fit" means we measured it — not guessed it</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="sp-detail-card">
      <h3 style="margin:0 0 12px; font-size:15px; color:#101828;">🛠️ What we stand behind</h3>
      <ul class="sp-feature-list">
        <li>60-day returns, no questions asked</li>
        <li>Free shipping over $99, ships same business day</li>
        <li>Install guides written by the techs who bench-fit the parts</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="text-align:center; margin-top:8px;">
    <a href="/demo" class="sp-pdp-cta" style="text-decoration:none;">Shop the catalog →</a>
  </div>
